11
00:00:47,578 --> 00:00:51,578
Morty (status): Opening the gripper.

12
00:00:51,189 --> 00:00:55,189
Morty (status): Should I go back home?

13
00:00:57,188 --> 00:01:01,188
You: Yes, go back home.

14
00:00:57,190 --> 00:01:01,190
Morty (status): Going home.

15
